{"id":"llamada","lemma":"llamada","pos":"noun","rank":443,"glosses":["call"],"ipa":"/ʝaˈmada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"llamadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-llamada.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesito hacer una llamada.","en":"I need to make a phone call.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/513185"},{"text":"Voy a hacer algunas llamadas.","en":"I'll make a few calls.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454371"},{"text":"Estoy esperando una llamada.","en":"I'm waiting for a phone call.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611911"},{"text":"Tom no respondió a mis llamadas.","en":"Tom didn't return my calls.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/119082"},{"text":"¿Puede alguien atender esa llamada?","en":"Can somebody get that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453830"}]}